{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/b7b891536ac87a79415de725008e3f24.avif?t=1764627786\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras_big/b7b891536ac87a79415de725008e3f24.avif?t=1764627786 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Afrofuturistic Sci-Fi Action RPG Where Your Fists, Choices, and Inner Power Change the Fate of a Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Unyverse</strong>, a groundbreaking Afrofuturistic sci-fi action RPG that fuses deep storytelling with fighting game combat. Create your hero and explore a galaxy where African cultures shape the stars, technology meets tradition, and your choices spark consequences that ripple across factions, alliances, and the fate of your homeworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a D'zola Warrior, your journey will challenge you to fight, trade, and navigate a living world filled with moral complexity, kinetic action, and untold mysteries. Unyverse delivers an experience unlike any RPG before it\u2014where every decision and every battle writes your legend in the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unyverse is a sci-fi action RPG that fuses story-driven role-playing with the kinetic intensity of fighting games.</strong> Created by Afrime Studios, Unyverse invites players into a vibrant Afrofuturistic world where your fists, blades, and choices shape the fate of entire factions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afrofuturism Reimagined:</strong><br>Explore a stunning sci-fi world inspired by the African diaspora, where culture, myth, and advanced technology collide in ways never seen in games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kinetic Fighting Game Combat:</strong><br>Master fast, fluid melee combat inspired by fighting games\u2014string combos, counter foes, and unleash devastating finishers in real-time action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven RPG Systems:</strong><br>Shape your story through morally complex decisions that impact factions, alliances, and your standing across the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your D'Zola Warrior:</strong>  <br>Take on the role of a <strong>D'Zola</strong>, an elite warrior whose powers could save or doom their home planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeroam Afrofuturistic Open Zones:</strong><br>Discover vast, living regions filled with side quests, rare resources, exotic creatures, and opportunities to trade, hunt, and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/a8a7457b51f1e3b3c231fe1c20005e82.avif?t=1764627786\" width=1187 height=345 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2834630?t=1764627786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2834630?t=1764627786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764627786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764627786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Included in PC Gamer's PC Gaming Show 12/4/25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl