rld inspired by the African diaspora, where culture, myth, and advanced technology collide in ways never seen in games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kinetic Fighting Game Combat:</strong><br>Master fast, fluid melee combat inspired by fighting games\u2014string combos, counter foes, and unleash devastating finishers in real-time action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven RPG Systems:</strong><br>Shape your story through morally complex decisions that impact factions, alliances, and your standing across the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your D'Zola Warrior:</strong>  <br>Take on the role of a <strong>D'Zola</strong>, an elite warrior whose powers could save or doom their home planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeroam Afrofuturistic Open Zones:</strong><br>Discover vast, living regions filled with side quests, rare resources, exotic creatures, and opportunities to trade, hunt, and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/a8a7457b51f1e3b3c231fe1c20005e82.avif?t=1764627786\" width=1187 height=345 /></span></p>","developers":["Afrime Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/header.jpg?t=1764627786","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2834630/1116295562/81292802d6d3877192bd8f62ff761e18ca0ecbd4/1764626253/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764627247","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2834630/11162